        "Content": "A Family Home, c. 18 Acres & Four Ways to Buy\r\n\r\nA good-sized three-bedroom home, c. 18 acres of land and Shercock Main Street just 600m away.\r\n\r\nThis holding at Crowley brings together family living, agricultural land and future potential in a location that is hard to beat.\r\n\r\nAt the centre is a well-proportioned three-bedroom bungalow, designed around a practical family layout with good living accommodation and plenty of room for everyday life. Outside, a useful shed and surrounding ground add to what the property offers.\r\n\r\nThe location is another major advantage. Shercock Main Street is just c.600m away, putting shops, schools, sports facilities and everyday amenities within easy reach while still having land and space around you.\r\n\r\nThe entire holding extends to c.18 acres and is being offered in four lots, allowing buyers to purchase the complete property, the home with adjoining land, or individual parcels of agricultural ground.\r\n\r\nLot 1 – Entire Holding | c.18 Acres\r\n\r\nThe complete property comprising the three-bedroom bungalow, shed and c.18 acres.\r\n\r\nFor anyone looking for a family home with land, this is the full opportunity. A substantial holding close to Shercock with good agricultural ground and further potential.\r\n\r\nLot 2 – House, Shed & c.1.27 Acres\r\n\r\nThe three-bedroom bungalow, shed and adjoining field, extending to c. 1.27 acres in total.\r\n\r\nThis lot puts the focus firmly on the home. A good-sized three-bedroom bungalow made for family living, with useful outside space, a shed and Shercock Main Street just c.600m away.\r\n\r\nIt offers the benefits of having ground around you without taking on the full agricultural holding.\r\n\r\nLot 3 – c. 8 Acres\r\n\r\nGood agricultural land extending to c. 8 acres and situated directly behind the home.\r\n\r\nAlongside its agricultural value, the land offers potential for a residential site or sites, subject to the necessary planning permissions being obtained.\r\n\r\nIts position close to Shercock makes this a real opportunity for both agricultural and longer-term use.\r\n\r\nLot 4 – c. 8.77 Acres\r\n\r\nA separate parcel of good agricultural land extending to c. 8.77 acres and situated approximately 1km from the home.\r\n\r\nA useful standalone block of ground for farmers or landowners looking to add acreage in the Shercock area.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n- Good-sized three-bedroom bungalow\r\n- Practical layout suited to family living\r\n- Just approx. 600m from Shercock Main Street\r\n- Entire holding extending to c. 18 acres\r\n- Useful shed\r\n- Offered in four lots\r\n- Option to purchase house and c. 1.27 acres separately\r\n- Good agricultural land\r\n- c. 8-acre parcel with site potential, subject to planning permission\r\n- Further c. 8.77-acre parcel approximately 1km away\r\n\r\nBuy the home. Buy the land. Or bring the entire 18 acres together. Crowley gives buyers options."
